      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear what youre saying but it feels so fake. like, how can i \"build new connections\" when the person people actually wanted to connect with is dead? it's like trying to run software on a computer that's been wiped clean. there's nothing left to run. it's just... a lot of effort to keep this shell moving around when the actual substance is gone. don't you think it's weird that we just keep acting like everything is fine when the core of us has been destroyed?",
